     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This is hopefully stating the obvious, but we should be using the Maven release plugin, see: ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://maven.apache.org/guides/mini/guide-releasing.html"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://maven.apache.org/guides/mini/guide-releasing.html",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "When I was using Maven to build the funapi service, uploading the release artifacts to Sourceforge via the release plugin wasn't working, but that may be resolved now (was a problem on SF's end, as I recall).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
