  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "We need to have a working, documented way of building all distributable artifacts for the Fedora release.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Right now it's possible to build the installer, but we also need to distribute (at least):",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "a source code release (zip)",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "the fedora-messaging client",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "the fedora-journaling-rmi receiver jar",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "an associated .md5 checksum file for each distributed file",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The automatically-built filenames should be exactly the filenames we want to distribute.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "We need:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "1) A decision on which exact files and filenames we're distributing for 3.3",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2) An automatic way to generate them, as build goals/targets",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "3) Documentation of how to generate them, in the \"Build the final distribution\" section of the \"Fedora Release Process\" document at ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCREPO/Fedora+Release+Process"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCREPO/Fedora+Release+Process",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
