      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>This is hopefully stating the obvious, but we should be using the Maven release plugin, see: <a href=\"http://maven.apache.org/guides/mini/guide-releasing.html\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://maven.apache.org/guides/mini/guide-releasing.html</a></p>\n\n<p>When I was using Maven to build the funapi service, uploading the release artifacts to Sourceforge via the release plugin wasn't working, but that may be resolved now (was a problem on SF's end, as I recall).</p>",
     "created": "03/Nov/09 2:53 PM",
